  "description": "Fully managed STL, OBJ, and 3MF rendering on the CPU for .NET. Includes explicit 3MF build/object selection, automatic camera framing, model rotation, configurable color, studio lighting, filtered shadows, ambient occlusion, and antialiasing. No native graphics dependencies or external renderer processes.",
